But if near, it should clamp so visible at edge when just offscreen. At <110, clamp true. If offscreen and clamped, it could still overlap; but near only. Better use clamp true and a custom safe area. I'll set showMarker minX to 64 and minY 132. Civilian marker near only.

Also tutorial objective marker currently clamped and at top-left; okay.

